Step 1: Go to Dialogflow → Create Agent → Name: FitnessBot

Step 2: Add these 6 intents:

2. Intents to Copy-Paste
① Welcome
User says: "hi", "hello", "help"
Bot replies:

text
Welcome to [Gym Name]! I can help with:
• Class schedules 🕐
• Equipment help 🏋️
• Membership info 💳
• Trainer booking 👨🏫
• Locker rentals 🔐
What do you need?
② Class Schedule
User says: "class times", "yoga schedule", "when is spin"
Bot replies:

text
**Class Schedule:**
• Yoga: Mon/Wed 8AM & 7PM
• Spin: Tue/Thu 6AM & 6PM
• Zumba: Sat 10AM
Full schedule: [your-link]
Book: Call 555-1234
③ Equipment Help
